  << /ActualText (NEEDS\nAlexander is looking for a premium and hassle\055free way to purchase his next car\056 He wants to compare BMW models\054 explore financing options\054 book a test drive\054 and customize the vehicle before visiting the showroom\056 He also expects transparent pricing and instant support through the app\056)
