  << /ActualText (FRUSTRATIONS\nVisiting multiple dealerships to compare prices\056\nHidden charges and unclear financing plans\056\nLong waiting times for test drive appointments\056\nDifficulty finding cars with preferred features and colors\056\nPoor customer support after booking\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 577 0 R
