  << /ActualText (PERSONALITY\nAlexander is a confident\054 tech\055savvy\054 and detail\055oriented buyer\056 He enjoys luxury products\054 values quality over price\054 and prefers making informed decisions through digital platforms\056 He appreciates a clean\054 modern\054 and easy\055to\055use app experience\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 579 0 R
