580 0 obj
  << /ActualText (GOALS\nBuy a new BMW within the next three months\056\nBook a test drive online in just a few taps\056\nCompare models\054 colors\054 and specifications easily\056\nReceive personalized finance and EMI options\056\nTrack the purchase and delivery status from the app\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 581 0 R
     /Pg 570 0 R
     /S /Span
