582 0 obj
  << /ActualText (BIO\nAlexander Thomas is a 30\055year\055old software engineer living in Bangalore\056 He has a stable income and is planning to buy his first luxury car\056 He researches every purchase carefully and prefers completing most of the buying journey online before visiting a showroom\056 He values convenience\054 transparent pricing\054 and personalized recommendations\056 A BMW dealership app helps him browse vehicles\054 compare models\054 book services\054 and stay connected with the dealership throughout the ownership journey\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 583 0 R
     /Pg 570 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
